WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.874 --> 00:00:07.874
family was moving.

2
00:00:09.174 --> 00:00:10.235
She was very sad.

3
00:00:11.535 --> 00:00:13.395
Christy did not want to leave her friends.

4
00:00:13.415 --> 00:00:16.896
"Don't worry, honey.

5
00:00:17.216 --> 00:00:19.957
You'll make new friends," Mom said.

6
00:00:19.977 --> 00:00:24.418
"You'll love the new house too," said Dad.

7
00:00:25.379 --> 00:00:26.779
But Christy was still sad.

8
00:00:28.519 --> 00:00:30.220
Christy did not like her new school.

9
00:00:31.456 --> 00:00:32.957
The kids did not speak to her.

10
00:00:33.997 --> 00:00:35.098
They did not play with her.

11
00:00:36.138 --> 00:00:37.919
Christy did not have any friends.

12
00:00:37.939 --> 00:00:42.321
"What did you do at school today?"

13
00:00:43.041 --> 00:00:43.641
asked Dad.

14
00:00:43.661 --> 00:00:48.724
"I'm sure there are many nice kids in your class," said Mom.

15
00:00:49.584 --> 00:00:50.984
Her parents were very worried.

16
00:00:53.606 --> 00:00:56.587
One day after school, Christy was walking home alone.

17
00:00:57.807 --> 00:00:58.968
She saw a little park.

18
00:01:00.076 --> 00:01:04.377
"I am going to take a walk in that park," Christy said to herself.

19
00:01:05.898 --> 00:01:07.538
The next day Christy was smiling.

20
00:01:07.558 --> 00:01:11.500
"Can I play in the park after school?"

21
00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:13.440
Christy asked cheerfully.

22
00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.701
"With who, Christy?"

23
00:01:16.081 --> 00:01:16.641
asked Mom.

24
00:01:16.661 --> 00:01:20.202
"With my new friend," smiled Christy.

25
00:01:20.222 --> 00:01:24.804
"Of course you can," Mom and Dad said happily.

26
00:01:26.472 --> 00:01:29.833
During lunchtime Christy ate only half of her ham sandwich.

27
00:01:30.814 --> 00:01:32.294
All day long she was smiling.

28
00:01:33.255 --> 00:01:35.396
Christy could not wait for school to be over.

29
00:01:36.756 --> 00:01:39.057
She wanted to go to the park to see her new friend.

30
00:01:43.099 --> 00:01:44.379
you have fun in the park?"

31
00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:45.560
asked Dad.

32
00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:48.561
"Oh yes," answered Christy.

33
00:01:48.581 --> 00:01:51.042
"What's your friend's name?"

34
00:01:51.502 --> 00:01:52.063
asked Mom.

35
00:01:52.083 --> 00:01:54.924
"Hammie!" Christy giggled.

36
00:01:57.864 --> 00:02:00.986
On Saturday Christy went to the park to see her new friend.

37
00:02:01.006 --> 00:02:04.348
"Do you want some of my sandwich?

38
00:02:05.528 --> 00:02:08.230
No one at school wants to be my friend.

39
00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:11.992
You're the only friend I have, Hammie."

40
00:02:14.053 --> 00:02:15.914
Christy was helping her mom make dinner.

41
00:02:15.934 --> 00:02:19.416
"Why don't you invite your friend for dinner?"

42
00:02:20.017 --> 00:02:20.697
Mom asked.

43
00:02:21.878 --> 00:02:25.980
"Uh, I think he's shy," Christy answered quickly.

44
00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:29.222
"Christy, is your friend a boy?"

45
00:02:30.363 --> 00:02:31.864
Mother said with surprise.

46
00:02:31.884 --> 00:02:36.068
"Excuse me, I have to get something from my room!"

47
00:02:40.391 --> 00:02:41.112
going on?"

48
00:02:41.872 --> 00:02:42.453
asked Dad.

49
00:02:42.473 --> 00:02:45.756
"Christy's new friend Hammie is a boy!"

50
00:02:46.096 --> 00:02:46.756
Mom said.

51
00:02:46.776 --> 00:02:48.838
"A boy!

52
00:02:49.419 --> 00:02:51.480
You mean Christy has a boyfriend?"

53
00:02:52.401 --> 00:02:53.042
said Dad.

54
00:02:53.742 --> 00:02:55.724
Christy's parents were worried once again.

55
00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:00.242
One day there was a new girl in Christy's class.

56
00:03:00.262 --> 00:03:03.384
"Class, this is Mina.

57
00:03:03.784 --> 00:03:06.626
Her family just moved here," said Mrs.

58
00:03:06.706 --> 00:03:10.368
Peters. "Mina, go and sit next to Christy."

59
00:03:10.388 --> 00:03:14.331
"Hi, Christy!

60
00:03:14.751 --> 00:03:15.972
Can I sit here?"

61
00:03:16.352 --> 00:03:16.912
asked Mina.

62
00:03:16.932 --> 00:03:19.374
"Sure," said Christy.

63
00:03:20.174 --> 00:03:21.776
The two girls began talking.

64
00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:28.221
"Let's walk home together!"

65
00:03:28.701 --> 00:03:29.282
said Mina.

66
00:03:29.302 --> 00:03:33.965
"Well, I have to meet my friend," said Christy.

67
00:03:33.985 --> 00:03:36.367
"Do you want to meet my friend?"

68
00:03:38.268 --> 00:03:40.770
The two girls chatted all the way to the park.

69
00:03:42.251 --> 00:03:43.712
It was already dark outside.

70
00:03:44.872 --> 00:03:46.113
Christy was not home yet.

71
00:03:47.874 --> 00:03:49.615
Her mom and dad were very worried.

72
00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:52.197
They knew she was at the park with Hammie.

73
00:03:54.038 --> 00:03:56.040
"Do you know what time it is, young lady?"

74
00:03:56.864 --> 00:03:57.824
Dad said angrily.

75
00:03:57.844 --> 00:04:00.205
"I'm sorry.

76
00:04:01.105 --> 00:04:03.806
I was in the park began Christy.

77
00:04:03.826 --> 00:04:07.708
"We know Hammie is your boyfriend!"

78
00:04:08.408 --> 00:04:09.888
shouted Mom and Dad together.

79
00:04:09.908 --> 00:04:11.769
"Go to your room!

80
00:04:12.289 --> 00:04:13.869
You are in big trouble!"

81
00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:17.731
Christy's parents were very upset.

82
00:04:18.531 --> 00:04:19.791
They did not know what to do.

83
00:04:20.572 --> 00:04:21.472
Then the phone rang.

84
00:04:24.568 --> 00:04:25.849
"My name is Mina.

85
00:04:26.269 --> 00:04:27.510
I'm Christy's friend."

86
00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:33.373
"I'm sorry, Mina, but Christy can't come to the phone right now," said Mom.

87
00:04:33.393 --> 00:04:40.717
"Can you tell Christy that I am going to bring some extra sandwiches for Hammie tomorrow?"

88
00:04:41.418 --> 00:04:42.038
Mina said.

89
00:04:42.058 --> 00:04:44.459
"You know Hammie?

90
00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:46.561
Tell me all about him.

91
00:04:47.341 --> 00:04:48.422
What does he look like?

92
00:04:48.822 --> 00:04:49.642
How old is he?"

93
00:04:50.203 --> 00:04:52.204
Christy's mom was getting upset again.

94
00:04:53.396 --> 00:04:56.338
"Hammie is a raccoon," said Mina.

95
00:04:56.358 --> 00:05:01.582
"Christy, we're so sorry for shouting at you."

96
00:05:02.122 --> 00:05:03.143
Mom hugged Christy.

97
00:05:03.163 --> 00:05:08.086
"We didn't know Hammie was a raccoon," said Dad.

98
00:05:08.106 --> 00:05:12.670
"We thought he was your secret boyfriend," said Mom.

99
00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:18.394
"I was so lonely until I met Hammie in the park," said Christy.

100
00:05:18.414 --> 00:05:21.556
"Every day he came to play with me.

101
00:05:22.376 --> 00:05:24.317
He was my only friend."

102
00:05:26.717 --> 00:05:29.878
The next day Christy went with Mina and her parents to the park.

103
00:05:30.598 --> 00:05:33.219
Soon Hammie came to say hello to his friends.

104
00:05:33.239 --> 00:05:39.201
"Mom, Dad, this is Hammie, my old friend," Christy said.

105
00:05:39.221 --> 00:05:43.002
"And this is Mina, my new friend."
